  "root_cause": "In middleware.py, the apply_config method assigns self._base directly to cfg, which is a reference to the original dictionary. When request_overrides are applied with cfg.update(request_overrides), it mutates the cached self._base dictionary, causing subsequent requests to inherit unintended modifications.",
